# The counter-melody (PLUCK): two pages in the ARP button's cycle (Acid, Acid env, Acid line, Pluck, Pluck 2), a Sound that SEL + ALGORITHM
# steps, a mute (GLO + B4) and a solo (GLO + F#5) of its own.
wait 3000
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
expect view 11
tap ARP
expect view 12
expect par98 30
turn K1 1
expect par98 31
turn K2 2
expect par99 3
wait 2000
shot pluck1.png
press SEL
turn ALGO 1
release SEL
expect par99 4
tap ARP
expect view 13
turn K2 1
expect par103 1
turn K3 1
expect par104 1
wait 2000
shot pluck2.png
tap ARP
expect view 9
press GLO
tapkey 18
release GLO
expect trkmute 128
press GLO
tapkey 25
release GLO
expect trksolo 128
press GLO
tapkey 23
release GLO
expect trkmute 0
expect trksolo 0